{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"提摩太前書","commonName":"提摩太前書","title":"提摩太前書","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"68d84534612c555ed5acd612f61b248c7b4112db9683a0204991b13a498f84cb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["有關禱告的指示"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我勸你，第一要為萬人懇求、禱告、代求、祝謝；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["為君王和一切在位的，也該如此，使我們可以敬虔、端正、平安無事地度日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["這是好的，在上帝我們救主面前可蒙悅納。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他願意萬人得救，明白真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因為只有一位上帝，在上帝和人中間，只有一位中保，乃是降世為人的基督耶穌；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他捨自己作萬人的贖價，到了時候，這事必證明出來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我為此奉派作傳道的，作使徒，作外邦人的師傅，教導他們相信，學習真道。我說的是真話，並不是謊言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我願男人無忿怒，無爭論",{"noteId":0},"，舉起聖潔的手，隨處禱告；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又願女人廉恥、自守，以正派衣裳為妝飾，不以編髮、黃金、珍珠，和貴價的衣裳為妝飾，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["只要有善行，這才與自稱是敬上帝的女人相宜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女人要沉靜學道，一味地順服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我不許女人講道，也不許她轄管男人，只要沉靜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為先造的是亞當，後造的是夏娃，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["且不是亞當被引誘，乃是女人被引誘，陷在罪裏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["然而，女人若常存信心、愛心，又聖潔自守，就必在生產上得救。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：疑惑","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}